{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mautix is an indie, creator-friendly 3D gallery builder</strong> \u2014 made for artists, collectors, and anyone who believes digital art deserves more than just a flat screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With near-zero entry barriers, Mautix lets you focus on your art instead of building entire 3D environments. We provide the space, tools, and atmosphere \u2014 you bring the creativity. Powered by Unreal Engine 5, exhibitions come alive with cinematic light, mood, and presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s a quiet tundra gallery or a surreal snowy exhibition, Mautix gives you the freedom to craft shows that feel intentional and alive. Here, art isn\u2019t just displayed \u2014 it\u2019s experienced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your gallery</strong> \u2013 Start from ready layouts and build a personal exhibition space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curate artworks</strong> \u2013 Place 2D images in frames; adjust position, scale, and aspect ratio safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light like a curator</strong> \u2013 Control spotlight intensity; preview with setup camera for accurate results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Swap environments and tweak ambience to match the mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong> \u2013 Add display props and plants to complete the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time publishing</strong> \u2013 Your gallery updates are instantly synced to the server, so visitors always see the latest version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share &amp; explore</strong> \u2013 Publish your Gallery ID and let others visit; browse community galleries for inspiration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Early Access: Features will continue to expand, guided by community feedback.)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2068740?t=1760934369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2068740?t=1760934369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068740/3bb49895c46f28b07a512240fbd297c21761f3b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760934369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068740/3bb49895c46f28b07a512240fbd297c21761f3b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760934369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some user galleries may include artistic depictions of the human body (e.g., classical or digital art nudes).\r\nThese are presented in an artistic, non-sexual, and non-pornographic context.\r\nUsers can toggle mature content filters or avoid such galleries entirely."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mautix is an indie, creator-friendly 3D gallery builder</strong> \u2014 made for artists, collectors, and anyone who believes digital art deserves more than just a flat screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With near-zero entry barriers, Mautix lets you focus on your art instead of building entire 3D environments. We provide the space, tools, and atmosphere \u2014 you bring the creativity. Powered by Unreal Engine 5, exhibitions come alive with cinematic light, mood, and presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s a quiet tundra gallery or a surreal snowy exhibition, Mautix gives you the freedom to craft shows that feel intentional and alive. Here, art isn\u2019t just displayed \u2014 it\u2019s experienced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features (Early Access)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your gallery</strong> \u2013 Start from ready layouts and build a personal exhibition space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curate artworks</strong> \u2013 Place 2D images in frames; adjust position, scale, and aspect ratio safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light like a curator</strong> \u2013 Control spotlight intensity; preview with setup camera for accurate results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Swap environments and tweak ambience to match the mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong> \u2013 Add display props and plants to complete the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time publishing</strong> \u2013 Your gallery updates are instantly synced to the server, so visitors always see the latest version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share &amp; explore</strong> \u2013 Publish your Gallery ID and let others visit; browse community galleries for inspiration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Early Access: Features will continue to expand, guided by community feedback.)</i></p>","developers":["Meovinci,LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068740/93f5afb622a547bb465dd71b86d78bd5113b3d98/header.jpg?t=1760934369","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a